  "job_B21.2.1.1.1_20251003_114535": {
    "text": "L\u00e6cedomas Wi\u00f0 eallum untrymnessum heafdes & hwanan ealles ge healfes heafdes ece cume &\n& hu mon scyle gebrocenes heafdes tiligean & gif \u00fe\u00e6t br\u00e6gen ut sie.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 eallum tiedernessum eagena wi\u00f0 eagna miste ge ealdes ge geonges mannes & hwanan\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 eallum earena ece & sare wi\u00fe earena deafe & wi\u00f0 yfelre hlyste & gif wyrmas on earan\nL\u00e6cecr\u00e6ftas wi\u00fe healsgunde & hu \u00feu meaht gecunnian hw\u00e6\u00feer hit healsgund sie & \u00fe\u00e6t sio adl is\nL\u00e6cedomas gif mannes mu\u00f0 sar sie ge tydred & wi\u00fe geblegnadre tungan mu\u00fe sealf wi\u00fe \u00feon ilcan, wi\u00f0\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 to\u00few\u00e6rce & gif wyrm to\u00fe ete & to\u00fesealfa, eft wi\u00f0 \u00feam uferan to\u00fe ece & wi\u00f0 \u00feam\nL\u00e6cedom gif mon blod hr\u00e6ce.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 bl\u00e6ce on andwlitan & briw wi\u00fe \u00feon ilcan & sealf, ealra feower.\nL\u00e6cedomas gif men yrne blod of nebbe, eft blodsetena ge on to bindanne ge on eare to donne ge horse\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe gesnote & wi\u00fe geposum.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe sarum weolorum.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00f0 weam mu\u00fee & wi\u00f0 ceolan swyle, \u00fery l\u00e6cedomas.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe h\u00e6rscearde.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe seadan.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 hwostan, hu he missenlice on man becym\u00f0 & hu his man tilian scyle & wyrtdrencas\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 breost w\u00e6rce, IIII cr\u00e6ftas.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe heortw\u00e6rce, V cr\u00e6ftas.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00feam miclan gic\u00fean & hu he cym\u00f0 of acolodum magan o\u00fe\u00fee to swi\u00f0e hatum o\u00f0\u00f0e of\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe wl\u00e6tan, twegen \u00e6\u00feele.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe sculdor w\u00e6rce, III cr\u00e6ftas.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re swi\u00f0ran sidan sare & \u00fe\u00e6re winestran, syx cr\u00e6ftas.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 lendenece, feower.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00feeohece, twegen, & an wi\u00fe \u00feon gif \u00feeoh slapan.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe cneow w\u00e6rce & gif cneow sar sie.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe scancena sare & gif scancan forade synd o\u00fe\u00fee o\u00feer lim, feower cr\u00e6ftas, & hu mon\nL\u00e6cedomas gif sin scrince & \u00e6fter \u00feam sie sar o\u00f0\u00f0e swelle o\u00f0\u00f0e gif monnes fot to hommum scrimme\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe fotece o\u00fe\u00fee o\u00feres limes o\u00fe\u00fee fota geswelle for miclan gange, VI cr\u00e6ftas.\nLac\u00e6domas wi\u00fe ban ece & sealf & drenc, \u00fery cr\u00e6ftas \u00fe\u00e6s synd.\nL\u00e6cedomas gif mannes getawa beo\u00fe sare o\u00fe\u00fee a\u00feundene, \u00fery cr\u00e6ftas.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00e6celman & wi\u00fe \u00f0on \u00f0e men acale \u00fe\u00e6t fel of \u00feam fotum.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00e6lcum heardum \u00feinge o\u00fe\u00fee swyle o\u00fe\u00fee geswelle & wi\u00fe \u00e6lcre yfelre swellendre\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 \u00feam yflan bl\u00e6ce hu man \u00fea sealfa & ba\u00feu & drencas wi\u00fe \u00f0on wyrcean scyle & wi\u00fe\nL\u00e6cedomas & drencas & sealfa & onlegna wi\u00fe springe ge adeadedum ge undeadedum, VIII cr\u00e6ftas.\nL\u00e6cedom gif n\u00e6gl sy of handa & wi\u00fe angn\u00e6gle & wi\u00fe weargbr\u00e6dan.\nL\u00e6cedomas micle & \u00e6\u00feele be asweartedum & adeadedum lice & hwanan sio adl cume.\n& hu his mon tilian scyle gif \u00fe\u00e6t lic to \u00feon swi\u00fee adeadige \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r gefelnes on ne sy.\n& hu mon \u00fe\u00e6t deade blod aweg wenian scyle & gif him mon lim ofceorfan scyle o\u00f0\u00f0e fyr onsettan hu\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re adle \u00fee mon h\u00e6t circuladl, briw & drencas & sealfa.\n\u00de\u00e6t is swi\u00fee freonu adl & her seg\u00fe hwilcne mete o\u00fe\u00fee drincan mon scyle on \u00fe\u00e6re adle forgan.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00f0on gif mon ne m\u00e6ge his micgean gehealdan & \u00fe\u00e6re geweald nage & gif he\nL\u00e6cecr\u00e6ftas & dolgsealfa & drencas wi\u00fe eallum wundum & cl\u00e6nsungum on \u00e6lce wisan, ge wi\u00f0\n& sealf gif \u00feu ra\u00f0e wille lytle wunde lacnian & gif mon mid isene gewundod sie o\u00fe\u00fee mid treowe\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 \u00e6lces cynnes omum & onfeallum & banco\u00feum, wi\u00fe ut ablegnedum omum & wi\u00fe\nL\u00e6cedomas & drencas & sealra wi\u00fe pocadle, ealfa syxe.\nL\u00e6cedomas \u00fery \u00e6\u00feele wi\u00fe innan onfealle & omum.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00f0\u00e6re geolwan adle & stanb\u00e6\u00fe & wi\u00fe gealadle sio cym\u00f0 of \u00fe\u00e6re geolwan adle.\nSio bi\u00fe adla ricust abitera\u00f0 se lichoma eall & ageolwa\u00fe swa god geolo seoluc.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe w\u00e6ter bollan.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 canceradle, \u00fe\u00e6t is bite, & smerenessa & sealf, feower cr\u00e6ftas.\nL\u00e6cedomas & drencas wi\u00fe \u00e6lcum attre, wi\u00f0 n\u00e6dran slege & bite & slite & wi\u00fe \u00feon gif mon atter\nGif hwa gedrince wyrm on w\u00e6tere wi\u00fe \u00feon l\u00e6cedomas & gif mon forboren sie, ealles XX cr\u00e6fta wi\u00f0\nL\u00e6cedomas gif anawyrm on men weaxe, sealf, drenc & clam wi\u00fe \u00feon.\nV l\u00e6cedomas \u00fe\u00e6s sint.\nL\u00e6cedomas & drencas & sealfa wi\u00fe \u00feeoradlum moniges cynnes, \u00fea betstan wi\u00fe \u00feeorwyrme on fet,\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00feam wyrmum \u00fee innan egla\u00f0 monnum & wi\u00fe wyrmum \u00fee on cilda inno\u00fee beo\u00fe &\nL\u00e6cedom on sundron anlipig wi\u00fe \u00feam smalan wyrme.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe hand wyrmum & deaw wyrmum & gif wyrm hand ete, weaxsealf wi\u00fe hand wyrme,\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe wyrmum \u00fee monnes fl\u00e6sc eta\u00fe.\nL\u00e6cedomas twegen wi\u00fe lusum.\nL\u00e6cedomas twegen wi\u00fe smoega wyrmum.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 wyrm\u00e6tum lice & cweldehtum.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe aslegenum lice.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe aslapenum lice & b\u00e6\u00fe sealf.\nL\u00e6cedomas & drencas & sealfa wi\u00fe fice.\nL\u00e6cedomas to wen sealfe & to wen bylum.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 paralisin \u00fe\u00e6t is on englisc lyftadl & wi\u00fe neurisne \u00fery.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 bryne & sealfa, VIII ealra.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe li\u00f0 w\u00e6rce & wi\u00f0 li\u00feseawe & gif li\u00feseaw sio & lio\u00feole utryrne, ealra cr\u00e6fta\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe feferadle to h\u00e6lanne, drencas wi\u00f0 \u00fean wi\u00fe \u00feriddan d\u00e6ges f\u00e6re & feor\u00fean d\u00e6ges f\u00e6re\n& hu man sceal wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re adle on husl disce \u00feone halgan & \u00feone miclan godes naman writan & on\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 feond seocum men, drencas to \u00feon & hu mon scyle m\u00e6ssan & gebedu & sealmas\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00e6lcre leodrunan & \u00e6lfsidenne, \u00fe\u00e6t is fefercynnes gealdor & dust & drencas & sealf\nL\u00e6cedomas eft wi\u00f0 lenctenadle & \u00feara feower godspellera naman & gewritu & gebedu & swigende\nL\u00e6cedomas ungemynde & wi\u00fe dysigum.\nL\u00e6cedomas & drencas wi\u00f0 genumenum mete & gif eala sie awerd o\u00fe\u00fee meolcen mete, \u00fery cr\u00e6ftas.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00feon gif hunta gebite mannan, \u00fe\u00e6t swi\u00f0re o\u00fere naman gangelwefra, sex dugende\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe wede hundes slite & wi\u00f0 hundes dolge, VII l\u00e6cedomas.\nL\u00e6cedomas gif mon sie to wr\u00e6ne o\u00fe\u00fee to unwr\u00e6ne.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe r\u00e6ge reosan sare & gif hoh sino forod sie.\nL\u00e6cedomas on hwilce tid blod sie to forganne on hwilce to forl\u00e6tenne & hu sie attres ful sio lyft on\nRomane & eall su\u00f0 folc worhton him eor\u00fe hus wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re unlyfte.\n& hu mon scyle blodl\u00e6se on \u00fe\u00e6ra sex fifa \u00e6lcon on \u00fe\u00e6s monan eldo forgan on \u00feritigum nihta &\nL\u00e6cedom gif men hwilc lim cine.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00f0 weartum & wearrum on lime.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe scurfedum n\u00e6gle.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00f0 gic\u00fean.\nL\u00e6cedom gif \u00feu wille \u00fe\u00e6t yfel swyle & \u00e6terno w\u00e6te ut berste.\nL\u00e6cedom gif men unlust sie getenge.\nL\u00e6cedom gif mon on langum wege teorige.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00f0 \u00feon \u00fee mon hine fordrince.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00f0 miclum cyle.\nL\u00e6cedom gif men sie f\u00e6ringa to micel w\u00e6c\u00e6 getenge.\nL\u00e6cedom to mannes stemne.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00f0 \u00feon gif mon \u00feung ete.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00f0 \u00feon \u00fee mon fundige wi\u00f0 his feond to gefeohtanne.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe miclum gange ofer land \u00fey l\u00e6s he teorige.\nL\u00e6cedom gif mannes feax fealle sealf wi\u00fe \u00feon & gif man calu sie.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe horses hreofle & gif hors geallede sie & gif hors sie ofscoten o\u00fe\u00fee o\u00feer neat.",
